1
00:00:03,920 --> 00:00:07,460
Chapter 19.

2
00:00:08,899 --> 00:00:13,819
After that, the little prince climbed a high mountain.

3
00:00:13,819 --> 00:00:18,020
The only mountains he had ever known were the three volcanoes, which came up

4
00:00:18,020 --> 00:00:24,139
to his knees. And to use the extinct volcano as a footstool.

5
00:00:24,139 --> 00:00:28,399
"From a mountain as high as this one," he said to himself,

6
00:00:28,399 --> 00:00:35,179
"I shall be able to see the whole planet at one glance, and all the people..."

7
00:00:35,179 --> 00:00:42,760
But he saw nothing, save peaks of rock that were sharpened like needles.

8
00:00:43,399 --> 00:00:48,979
"Good morning," he said courteously.

9
00:00:48,979 --> 00:00:59,479
"Good morning-- --Good morning-- --Good morning," answered the echo.

10
00:00:59,479 --> 00:01:01,698
"Who are you?"

11
00:01:01,698 --> 00:01:04,460
said the little prince.

12
00:01:04,460 --> 00:01:14,899
"Who are you-- --Who are you-- --Who are you repeat it the echo.

13
00:01:14,899 --> 00:01:17,119
"Be my friends.

14
00:01:17,119 --> 00:01:20,500
I am all alone

15
00:01:21,260 --> 00:01:33,380
I am all alone-- --all alone-- --all alone came the reply from the echo.

16
00:01:33,380 --> 00:01:41,119
"What a queer planet thought The Little Prince It is all together dry, and altogether

17
00:01:41,119 --> 00:01:46,219
pointed, and all together harsh and forbidding. And the people have no

18
00:01:46,219 --> 00:01:50,539
imagination. They repeat whatever one says to them...

19
00:01:50,539 --> 00:01:58,060
On my planet I had a flower; she always was the first to speak
